abstract: >
  anchorgate scores saved predictions of a spatiotemporal field against untrained references
  (per-cell climatology, persistence, seasonal naive) on identical targets, audits whether a
  cross-validation assignment is out of sample given the forecast horizon, resolves seed
  variance before any architectural claim, reads its verdicts from block-bootstrap intervals
  and refuses conclusions the computations do not support. A declaration fixes the design of
  the evaluation; every result records the parameters it used and any departure from it, and
  the report identifies the design by its hash.
